xtend.dual or IsCausalIso.curvesExtend, so Basic.lean serves no label. Rows with pre-existing curve-free forms of their decls (not by this target): lem:image_diamant, lem:passe_pgcd, lem:Sigma_separe (ett), ersprop:PropLocUniqueness (ers-predictability). No paper finding and no question: the target changes no reading."
